{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of spy films, this DLC drops you into a world of covert operations, hidden gadgets, and daring escapes. Work alone or with your team to unravel codes, outsmart villains, and foil sinister plots in four all-new escape rooms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agency HQ</strong> \u2013 Earn your clearance and prove you\u2019ve got what it takes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quartermaster\u2019s Workshop</strong> \u2013 Test out ingenious gadgets before heading into the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Villain\u2019s Yacht</strong> \u2013 Mingle with high society while uncovering dangerous secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underwater Rocket Base</strong> \u2013 Stop the launch and save the world from below the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the new rooms, you\u2019ll unlock:<br>\u2022 Spy-themed <strong>outfits</strong> to slip into character<br>\u2022 New gadgets and <strong>props for the Room Editor</strong>, bringing espionage flair to your own creations<br>\u2022 A sleek cinematic <strong>soundtrack</strong> to set the mood for your covert adventures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your wits, trust no one, and remember: <strong>Your mission is to escape!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972570?t=1757021921","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972570/8c8479f30a66421ea1d7ed4f0183a1d54babfa9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757021921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972570/77665a162e6c4beb4edddb87908589581e883787/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757021921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972570/77665a162e6c4beb4edddb87908589581e883787/capsule_184x69.